// How long to wait for a defender to pick a skill before defaulting.
const DEFENDER_CHOICE_TIMEOUT_MS = 20000;
const DEFENDER_CHOICE_DEFAULT = 'Athletics';

// --- Can this even be attempted? -------------------------------------------------
// Every reason is reported BEFORE target selection, so a disabled control can
// explain itself rather than a player discovering the problem after aiming.
// ============================================================================
// CONTEST STAGES (v9.48)
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// `ContestFlow` could RECEIVE a target but had no way to choose one: opened
// from the drawer it began with `targetId: null` and could never proceed.
// These are the stages, and `contestStagesFor` omits the ones that do not
// apply - a grapple has no mode to pick, an escape has no target to choose.
